@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3333

### Listar notas
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes

### Buscar a nota 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/1

### Nota que nao existe (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/999

### Id invalido (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/abc


### Id decimal (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/1.5

### Id zero (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/0

### Id negativo (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/-1


### Criar nota (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Estudar Zod",
  "content": "Validacao de entrada"
}

### Criar so com titulo (201, content vazio)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "So titulo" }

### Criar sem titulo (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "sem titulo" }

### Criar com titulo so de espacos (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "     " }

### JSON quebrado (400, erro do proprio Fastify)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": 

### Substituir a nota 1 (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "HTTP revisado", "content": "Idempotencia e status codes" }

### Substituir faltando campo (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "So titulo" }

### Alterar parte da nota 1 (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "So o titulo mudou" }

### PATCH vazio (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Alterar nota que nao existe (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/notes/999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "fantasma" }

### Remover a nota 2 (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notes/2

### Remover de novo (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/notes/2